// Night behind the pumpkin: stars (N4, N5), a two-row 50% checker from N1
// to N2 at the horizon, hills and ground in N0, and a moonlit crest (N3).
// The scene is anchored to the bottom of the sidebar; when the sidebar is
// short, rows are cropped from the top (PX-2).
size 60x48
origin 0 0

frame night
